<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">找一位合适的陪伴者</view>
    <view class="hero-copy">所有沟通都在平台内完成，守住边界也守住安心。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="filter-panel">
    <view class="search-heading">搜索公开资料</view>
    <view class="search-row">
      <input class="search-input" value="{{searchInput}}" maxlength="40" confirm-type="search" placeholder="名称、角色、服务或标签" bindinput="setSearchInput" bindconfirm="submitSearch" />
      <button class="search-submit" bindtap="submitSearch">搜索</button>
    </view>
    <view class="search-copy">提交后才会查询；只检索当前公开的名称、角色、服务和标签，不保存搜索历史。</view>
    <view class="filter-heading">按当前服务筛选</view>
    <view class="filter-copy">默认只显示未来 7 天内有上架商品和结构化剩余容量的资料；价格按单次服务总价，“3天内可约”会进一步收窄范围。详情页和下单都会再次校验。</view>
    <view class="filter-group">
      <view class="filter-label">主题</view>
      <scroll-view class="filter-scroll" scroll-x="true" enable-flex="true" show-scrollbar="false">
        <view class="filter-options">
          <button class="filter-chip {{!selectedTopicId ? 'filter-chip-selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectTopic" data-id="">全部主题</button>
          <button wx:for="{{topicFilters}}" wx:key="id" class="filter-chip {{item.selected ? 'filter-chip-selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectTopic" data-id="{{item.id}}">{{item.name}}</button>
        </view>
      </scroll-view>
    </view>
    <view class="filter-group filter-group-last">
      <view class="filter-label">服务方式</view>
      <view class="filter-options">
        <button class="filter-chip {{!selectedDeliveryMode ? 'filter-chip-selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectDeliveryMode" data-value="">全部方式</button>
        <button wx:for="{{deliveryModeFilters}}" wx:key="value" class="filter-chip {{item.selected ? 'filter-chip-selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectDeliveryMode" data-value="{{item.value}}">{{item.label}}</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="filter-group filter-group-last">
      <view class="filter-label">单次服务总价上限</view>
      <view class="filter-options">
        <button class="filter-chip {{!selectedMaxServicePriceCents ? 'filter-chip-selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectPriceLimit" data-value="0">全部价格</button>
        <button wx:for="{{priceFilters}}" wx:key="value" class="filter-chip {{item.selected ? 'filter-chip-selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectPriceLimit" data-value="{{item.value}}">{{item.label}}</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="filter-group filter-group-last">
      <view class="filter-label">可约时间</view>
      <view class="filter-options">
        <button class="filter-chip {{!selectedAvailableWithinDays ? 'filter-chip-selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectAvailabilityWithinDays" data-value="0">不限</button>
        <button wx:for="{{availabilityWithinDaysFilters}}" wx:key="value" class="filter-chip {{item.selected ? 'filter-chip-selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectAvailabilityWithinDays" data-value="{{item.value}}">{{item.label}}</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="filter-group filter-group-last">
      <view class="filter-label">公开排序</view>
      <scroll-view class="filter-scroll" scroll-x="true" enable-flex="true" show-scrollbar="false">
        <view class="filter-options">
          <button class="filter-chip {{!selectedSortBy ? 'filter-chip-selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectPublicSort" data-value="">默认 / 推荐</button>
          <button wx:for="{{publicSortFilters}}" wx:key="value" class="filter-chip {{item.selected ? 'filter-chip-selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectPublicSort" data-value="{{item.value}}">{{item.label}}</button>
        </view>
      </scroll-view>
      <view class="sort-copy">主动选择后只按公开信息排序；“最早可约”只看未来 7 天内（已选更短窗口时按该窗口）结构化、未满额的候选，不会保留时段。不选时首页沿用推荐；价格和可约情况仍以详情页及下单时为准。</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{isFiltering}}" class="filter-summary">
      <text>当前条件：{{activeFilterSummary || '已选服务条件'}}</text>
      <button class="filter-clear" bindtap="clearFilters">清除条件，恢复推荐</button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="empty">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!companions.length}}" class="empty filter-empty">
    <view wx:if="{{selectedSortBy === 'soonestAvailable'}}">暂时没有同时符合当前条件的结构化可约候选。</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{selectedKeyword}}">没有找到与“{{selectedKeyword}}”匹配的当前公开资料或服务。</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{isFiltering}}">暂时没有符合当前公开服务条件的陪伴者。</view>
    <view wx:else>暂时还没有可预约的陪伴者，稍后再来看看。</view>
    <button wx:if="{{isFiltering}}" class="empty-clear" bindtap="clearFilters">清除条件，恢复推荐</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:else>
    <view class="filter-result-note" wx:if="{{selectedSortBy === 'soonestAvailable'}}">{{activeFilterSummary || '最早可约'}} · 只按本次读取的结构化剩余容量排序，不保留时段；详情页和下单会再次校验</view>
    <view class="filter-result-note" wx:elif="{{isFiltering}}">{{activeFilterSummary || '当前条件'}} · 仅显示仍公开、商品上架且有真实可约容量的结果</view>
    <view class="recommendation-note" wx:if="{{!recommendationFallback && !isFiltering}}">根据你的设置、当前场景与服务状态推荐；可在“我的”中关闭。</view>
    <view id="discover-recommendation-{{item.impressionId}}" class="card companion" wx:for="{{companions}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="openCompanion" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-impression-id="{{item.impressionId}}" data-theme-id="{{selectedTopicId || item.topicIds[0]}}">
      <view class="avatar">{{item.initials}}</view>
      <view class="content">
        <view class="row"><text class="name">{{item.name}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.isVerified}}" class="verified">已认证</text></view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.role}} · {{item.availability}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.reasonText}}" class="reason">{{item.reasonText}}</view>
        <view class="bio">{{item.bio}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.nextAvailableText}} · {{item.catalogDetailText}}</view>
        <view class="row footer"><text>★ {{item.rating}}（{{item.reviewCount}}）</text><text>{{item.catalogPriceText}}</text></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
